"Allow Location access in Settings to show your real position." = "请在系统设置中允许定位权限，以显示真实位置。";
"Your real location is not available yet." = "暂时无法获取真实位置，请稍后重试。";

/* About and in-app guide */
"Choose, test and move this iPhone’s reported location from one clean map." = "在一张地图上选择、测试和移动本机报告的位置。";
"How it works" = "快速开始";
"WrapPin is intended for location-based app development and testing on your own device." = "WrapPin 用于在你拥有并控制的设备上进行定位开发和测试。";
"Pair this iPhone once." = "完成一次本机配对。";
"Connect %@." = "连接 %@。";
"Search, choose or drop a location." = "搜索地点，或直接在地图上选点。";
"Start a fixed location or preview a walking route." = "开始固定位置模拟，或先预览步行路线。";
"Search" = "搜索";
"Find a place by name or enter latitude and longitude. Choosing a result also clears the search ready for the next one." = "按名称搜索地点，或直接输入经纬度。选择结果后，搜索框会自动清空。";
"Tap the map" = "轻点地图";
"Drop a precise pin anywhere on the map. The close button on its card clears that pin." = "轻点地图即可放置精确位置点，地点卡片上的关闭按钮可以清除该位置。";
"Favourite" = "收藏";
"Save the selected place for quick use later. Favourites can be renamed, reordered or removed from the saved-locations screen." = "收藏常用地点，之后可以重命名、调整顺序或删除。";
"Favourites & history" = "收藏与历史";
"Open saved favourites and recently used locations. Swipe an item to remove it." = "查看收藏和最近使用的位置，左滑可删除。";
"Map controls" = "地图操作";
"Current location" = "真实位置";
"Fly back to this iPhone’s real location and return the map to north-up." = "回到本机真实位置，并将地图转回正北。";
"Compass" = "指南针";
"Appears when the map is rotated. It shows the map heading; tap it to face north again." = "旋转地图后会显示指南针，轻点即可恢复正北方向。";
"Connection status" = "连接状态";
"Shows whether WrapPin is ready, connecting or active. Tap it for pairing and connection details." = "显示本机是否已就绪、正在连接或模拟定位中。轻点可查看设备连接详情。";
"Change appearance and map style, check the connection, manage pairing and view app information." = "调整外观和地图样式，检查连接、管理配对并查看 App 信息。";
"Location control" = "模拟定位";
"Start reporting the selected place as this iPhone’s location. %@ must be connected." = "将所选地点设为本机报告的位置。开始前必须连接 %@。";
"Move an active location session to a newly selected place without restarting the whole connection flow." = "模拟定位运行时，可以直接切换到新地点，无需重新连接。";
"Confirm before ending the active session and restoring this iPhone’s real location." = "结束模拟定位并恢复本机真实位置前会再次确认。";
"Mobile-data guidance" = "蜂窝网络引导";
"When using mobile data, temporarily turn it off when asked. WrapPin continues automatically once the local connection is available, and tells you when data can go back on." = "使用蜂窝网络时，请按提示暂时关闭蜂窝数据。建立本机连接后会自动继续，并提示何时可以重新开启。";
"Interrupted-session recovery" = "中断恢复";
"If WrapPin did not receive a normal end signal, the next launch offers to resume, reconnect briefly to restore the real location, or confirm that it is already back." = "如果上次没有正常结束，再次打开时可以继续任务、短暂重连以恢复真实位置，或确认真实位置已经恢复。";
"Walking routes" = "步行路线";
"Ask Apple Maps for a walking route from your current point to the selected destination before anything starts." = "开始前，先通过 Apple 地图规划从当前位置到目的地的步行路线。";
"Choose how quickly the simulated location moves along the route." = "选择模拟位置沿路线移动的速度。";
"Begin moving the reported location along the previewed route. The walk can continue while you use another app." = "让模拟位置沿预览路线移动；切换到其他 App 后仍可继续。";
"Pause or Resume" = "暂停或继续";
"Hold the current point on the route, then continue from exactly where it paused." = "将模拟位置停在当前路线点，之后可以从这里继续。";
"After arrival, reverse the journey and walk back along the route." = "到达后沿原路线反向返回。";
"Keep the active session and return to the map so you can choose another destination." = "保持当前连接并返回地图，选择新的目的地。";
"Stop walking, clear the route and restore the real location. A confirmation helps prevent accidental stops." = "停止模拟步行、清除路线并恢复真实位置。操作前会再次确认。";
"Setup & support" = "设置与帮助";
"Pair this iPhone once so WrapPin can identify it through %@." = "只需配对一次，之后 WrapPin 即可通过 %@ 识别本机。";
"Check pairing and the local connection without changing your location. You can also share a readable diagnostics report." = "检查配对和本机连接，不会修改当前位置。也可以复制便于阅读的诊断报告。";
"View onboarding again without deleting your pairing, favourites, history or preferences." = "重新查看使用介绍，不会删除配对、收藏、历史记录或偏好设置。";
"Erase the pairing record and all saved app choices, then return to onboarding. LocalDevVPN itself is not changed." = "删除配对记录和所有本地设置，然后返回首次使用页面；不会更改 LocalDevVPN。";

/* Anonymous usage statistics */
"Anonymous Statistics" = "匿名使用统计";
"Shared" = "会发送";
"Never Shared" = "绝不发送";
"Storage and Control" = "存储与控制";
"WrapPin sends only a small, fixed set of anonymous activity counts when sharing is enabled." = "开启后，WrapPin 只发送少量固定的匿名使用计数。";
"Hashed random installation identifier" = "经过哈希处理的随机安装标识";
"Approximate event time" = "大致事件时间";
"App opened or returned to foreground" = "App 打开或回到前台";
"App version and build" = "App 版本和构建号";
"Introduction completed" = "完成首次使用介绍";
"Connection help, retry and retry success counts" = "连接帮助、重试及重试成功次数";
"Fixed failure stage, scheduler reason, operation and recovery category" = "固定的失败阶段、调度原因、操作和恢复类别";
"Pairing completed" = "完成配对";
"Fixed or walking session started" = "开始固定位置或步行模拟";
"Active location updated" = "更新正在模拟的位置";
"Locations or coordinates" = "位置或坐标";
"Searches, favourites or history" = "搜索、收藏或历史记录";
"Walking routes or destinations" = "步行路线或目的地";
"Pairing records, PINs or device names" = "配对记录、PIN 或设备名称";
"Diagnostics or raw error messages" = "诊断信息或错误原文";
"Apple ID or personal details" = "Apple ID 或个人信息";
"A random identifier is created for this installation and irreversibly hashed before it is sent. It is used only to estimate activity from participating installations." = "本次安装会生成一个随机标识，发送前会进行不可逆哈希处理，仅用于估算参与统计的安装数量。";
"Turning sharing off immediately stops new reporting and removes the identifier from WrapPin. It cannot withdraw anonymous events already received by TelemetryDeck." = "关闭后会立即停止发送新数据，并删除本机标识；TelemetryDeck 已收到的匿名事件无法撤回。";
"TelemetryDeck says it does not store IP addresses. Anonymous events may be retained for roughly 7–10 years, with no guaranteed exact deletion date." = "TelemetryDeck 表示不会存储 IP 地址。匿名事件可能保留约 7 至 10 年，无法保证准确删除日期。";
"WrapPin uses a narrow first-party sender instead of an analytics SDK, so extra device metadata cannot be added automatically." = "WrapPin 没有集成分析 SDK，而是使用受限的内置发送模块，避免自动附带额外设备信息。";

/* Native bridge errors */
"WrapPin could not start its pairing engine." = "WrapPin 无法启动本机配对引擎。";
"WrapPin could not open a local pairing connection." = "WrapPin 无法建立本机配对连接。";
"WrapPin could not determine its pairing port." = "WrapPin 无法确定配对端口。";
"The iPhone could not connect to WrapPin." = "iPhone 无法连接 WrapPin。";
"WrapPin could not confirm stopping location simulation." = "WrapPin 无法确认停止模拟定位。";
"The iPhone did not confirm stopping location simulation in time." = "iPhone 未能及时确认停止模拟定位。";
"Simulation coordinate mode" = "模拟坐标方式";
"GCJ-02 correction" = "GCJ-02 校正";
"WGS84 unchanged" = "WGS84 原样";
"For mainland China, try GCJ-02 first. If the position is off, switch to WGS84." = "中国大陆可先试 GCJ-02；位置有偏差就切换 WGS84。";
"Outside mainland China, try WGS84 first. If the position is off, switch to GCJ-02." = "中国大陆以外可先试 WGS84；位置有偏差就切换 GCJ-02。";
"WrapPin %@ is available." = "WrapPin %@ 已发布。";
"View release and download" = "查看版本并下载";
"Dismiss update reminder" = "关闭更新提醒";
"Close route preview" = "关闭路线预览";
"View release %@" = "查看版本 %@";
"WrapPin checks the latest public GitHub release when it opens. You can check again here. Location, pairing and diagnostic data are not sent with this request." = "WrapPin 启动时会检查 GitHub 上最新的正式版，也可在此手动重查。请求不会发送位置、配对或诊断数据。";
"地图选点" = "地图选点";
"模拟目标" = "模拟目标";
"定位回调" = "定位回调";
"数值距离" = "数值距离";
"水平精度" = "水平精度";
"回调时间" = "回调时间";
"软件模拟标记" = "软件模拟标记";
"定位精度调研" = "定位精度调研";
"正在获取新的定位回调，最多等待 15 秒…" = "正在获取新的定位回调，最多等待 15 秒…";
"使用独立定位读取器获取新的 Core Location 回调，关闭页面即清除。数值距离不能单独证明 Apple 地图蓝点的显示坐标。" = "使用独立定位读取器获取新的 Core Location 回调，关闭页面即清除。数值距离不能单独证明 Apple 地图蓝点的显示坐标。";
"Switching modes updates the current simulated location immediately." = "切换后会立即更新当前模拟位置。";
"Use Built-in Tunnel" = "使用内置隧道";
"Built-in Tunnel" = "内置隧道";
"Disconnected" = "未连接";
"Start Built-in Tunnel" = "开启内置隧道";
"Stop Built-in Tunnel" = "关闭内置隧道";
"After allowing its VPN configuration once, WrapPin starts this local device tunnel for location sessions and stops it after a successful restore. A tunnel you start here stays on until you stop it. A compatible signing profile is required." = "首次允许添加 VPN 配置后，WrapPin 会在模拟定位时开启本机隧道，成功恢复真实位置后关闭。在这里手动开启的隧道会一直保持，直到你手动关闭。签名配置需要支持网络扩展。";
"Built-in tunnel did not connect in time." = "内置隧道未能及时连接。";
"WrapPin could not start its built-in tunnel." = "WrapPin 无法启动内置隧道。";
"Starting built-in tunnel…" = "正在启动内置隧道…";
"WrapPin is connecting its built-in device tunnel." = "WrapPin 正在连接内置设备隧道。";
"Check that WrapPin's built-in tunnel is connected, then try again. If you are using mobile data, follow the mobile data steps below." = "确认 WrapPin 的内置隧道已连接后重试。如果正在使用蜂窝数据，请按下方步骤操作。";
"Keep the built-in tunnel connected, switch mobile data off briefly, then return to WrapPin." = "保持内置隧道连接，暂时关闭蜂窝数据，然后返回 WrapPin。";
"WrapPin uses its built-in device tunnel. If another VPN is active, stop it before testing this tunnel." = "WrapPin 正在使用内置设备隧道。测试前请先关闭其他 VPN。";
"Built-in VPN" = "内置 VPN";
"Disconnecting" = "断开中";
"Allow WrapPin's built-in VPN" = "允许 WrapPin 添加内置 VPN";
"The first location session asks to add a VPN configuration; WrapPin then starts its local device tunnel automatically." = "首次模拟定位时，系统会询问是否允许添加 VPN 配置；之后 WrapPin 会自动启动本机设备隧道。";
"Allow WrapPin to add its built-in VPN when prompted." = "系统提示时，允许 WrapPin 添加内置 VPN。";
"WrapPin can use this record with its built-in device tunnel." = "内置设备隧道连接后，WrapPin 可以使用这份配对记录。";
"Start reporting the selected place. WrapPin starts its built-in tunnel automatically." = "将选中的地点报告为这台 iPhone 的位置。WrapPin 会自动启动内置隧道。";
"Pair this iPhone once so WrapPin can identify it through its built-in tunnel." = "配对本机一次，WrapPin 即可通过内置隧道识别它。";
"Erase the pairing record and all saved app choices, then return to onboarding. Existing VPN configurations remain in iOS Settings." = "清除配对记录和本机设置，然后返回首次使用引导。已有 VPN 配置仍保留在 iOS 设置中。";
"Allow WrapPin's built-in VPN when prompted." = "系统提示时允许添加 WrapPin 内置 VPN。";
"This clears the pairing record and local app settings, then shows onboarding again. VPN configurations remain in iOS Settings." = "这会清除配对记录与本机设置，然后重新显示首次使用引导。VPN 配置仍保留在 iOS 设置中。";
"Use Built-in Tunnel for Location Sessions" = "模拟定位时使用内置隧道";
"Start Tunnel" = "开启隧道";
"Stop Tunnel" = "关闭隧道";
"Tunnel" = "隧道";
"WrapPin starts the tunnel when a location session needs it and stops it after a successful restore. A tunnel started here stays on until you stop it. iOS may ask you to allow a VPN configuration the first time." = "模拟定位需要时，WrapPin 会启动隧道；成功恢复真实位置后会关闭。在这里手动开启的隧道会保持连接，直到你手动关闭。首次使用时，iOS 可能会请求添加 VPN 配置。";
"Needs Attention" = "需要处理";
"Addresses" = "地址";
"Local Address" = "本机地址";
"Peer Address" = "对端地址";
"Edit Local Address" = "修改本机地址";
"The default address matches this build's existing tunnel. Change only the local IPv4 address if another tool needs a different one. The peer stays at 10.7.0.1. Changes take effect the next time the tunnel starts." = "默认地址沿用已验证的隧道设置。仅当其他工具需要不同的本机地址时才修改；对端地址保持 10.7.0.1。修改会在下次开启隧道时生效。";
"How It Works" = "使用说明";
"The tunnel routes only the paired iPhone's 10.7.0.1 connection. Other traffic keeps using your normal network. iOS allows one active VPN at a time, so starting this tunnel may disconnect another VPN." = "隧道只处理连接已配对 iPhone 的 10.7.0.1 流量；其他流量继续走原有网络。iOS 同时只能启用一个 VPN，开启本隧道可能会断开其他 VPN。";
"The app and its tunnel extension both need signing profiles that allow Packet Tunnel. If iOS rejects the VPN configuration, check the signed installation and the VPN entry in iPhone Settings." = "App 和内置扩展的签名配置都必须允许 Packet Tunnel。若 iOS 拒绝 VPN 配置，请检查签名后的安装包，以及 iPhone 设置中的 VPN 条目。";
"Local IPv4/CIDR" = "本机 IPv4/CIDR";
"Restore Default Address" = "恢复默认地址";
"For example, 10.7.0.2/30" = "例如 10.7.0.2/30";
"Use an IPv4 address with a prefix, such as 10.7.0.2/30. Do not use the peer address 10.7.0.1." = "请输入带前缀的 IPv4 地址，例如 10.7.0.2/30。不要使用对端地址 10.7.0.1。";
"Enter a valid local IPv4 address and prefix. It must differ from 10.7.0.1." = "请输入有效的本机 IPv4 地址和前缀，且不能与 10.7.0.1 相同。";
"VPN Configuration Disabled" = "VPN 配置已关闭";
"Built-in tunnel did not connect in time. Check the VPN configuration and signing permissions, then try again." = "内置隧道连接超时。请检查 VPN 配置和签名权限后重试。";
"iOS still keeps this VPN configuration disabled. Open Settings > General > VPN & Device Management > VPN, enable WrapPin, then try again. If it cannot be enabled, check both signing profiles." = "iOS 仍将这条 VPN 配置保持关闭。请到“设置 → 通用 → VPN 与设备管理 → VPN”启用 WrapPin 后重试；若无法启用，请检查 App 和扩展的两份签名配置。";
"The VPN configuration changed. Close this page and try again." = "VPN 配置已发生变化。请关闭本页后重试。";
"Could not start the built-in tunnel (%@). Check VPN approval and signing permissions, then try again." = "无法开启内置隧道（%@）。请检查 VPN 授权和签名权限后重试。";
"iOS could not read or save the VPN configuration. Check VPN approval and the app and extension signing profiles, then try again." = "iOS 无法读取或保存 VPN 配置。请检查 VPN 授权，以及 App 和扩展的签名配置后重试。";
